[Severity: High]
Can calling ptp_clock_unregister() here introduce an AB-BA deadlock?

Looking at idtfc3_probe(), it acquires idtfc3->lock and calls
idtfc3_enable_ptp():

drivers/ptp/ptp_fc3.c:idtfc3_probe() {
    ...
