 drivers/video/logo/Makefile      |   6 +-
 drivers/video/logo/ppmtodtlogo.c | 402 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 407 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/video/logo/ppmtodtlogo.c

